# 20. Is Bittensor still alive?

**Yes—very much so technically.**

As of July 2026, Bittensor shipped its v431 upgrade; its Python SDK/CLI moved to v11 with a Rust core, and its current network model still revolves around independent subnets where miners produce a digital commodity and validators score their contribution. ([Bittensor][17])

The economics have evolved substantially around Dynamic TAO/subnet-specific tokens and market-influenced emission allocation. ([Bittensor][18])

I would separate that from whether you should **use** it.

